<h1 style=3D"margin:0; font-size:30px; line-height:125%"><span style=3D"col=
or: #192733;">How the poinsettia took over Christmas</span></h1>
<p style=3D"font-size:18px; line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"font-size:18px; line-height:125%"><span style=3D"color: #192733=
;"><em>The story of America=E2=80=99s favorite holiday plant is rife with i=
nternational politics, spoiled trade secrets, and a toppled monopoly.</em><=
/span></p>
<p style=3D"font-size:13px; line-height:125%; font-weight:bold">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"font-size:13px; line-height:125%; font-weight:bold"><br><span s=
tyle=3D"color: #192733;">BY <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB=
+113/d2q-Vf04/VXdJJl2rPQ6rW7JK80z6p4Z2sVmLt1V5HkyHtN5wYXQs2-ZW0W50kgx26lZ3m=
0W7XmvXJ4T4jd9W5VLRfJ2VTmKbVgFG4T6XvW-dW3JbmqX8QpbqqW3Rc5nc423pJhW6q21j_97X=
rVCW1mH17_75gd9fN1j4h7hdtYzyW1N82gD1yr7C1W9fRyNB3vJHd_W2zbrQc46ZKWYW8S6kDr8=
wGnQgN5PXDgtFc8kMW9d16Wz5q5q9ZVY_ch_3X-dVBW2WwbJf5bHdr8f2wZ_gC04" style=3D"=
font-weight:bold; color:#192733; text-decoration:none !important" rel=3D"no=
opener" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"CAzB/nO2" target=3D"_bl=
ank">ZACHARY CROCKETT</a></span></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">The poinsettia plant is a ubiquitous Christma=
s staple.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Every year, just after Thanksgiving, it emerg=
es en masse at nurseries, big-box retailers, fundraisers, and holiday parti=
es.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">It=E2=80=99s one of the most popular plants i=
n the world, with annual sales of <span style=3D"font-weight: bold;">~90m u=
nits</span> and a global retail impact of nearly <span style=3D"font-weight=
: bold;">$1B</span>.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">But behind the beautiful, blood-red bracts of=
 the poinsettia, there=E2=80=99s a story rife with geopolitics, patent wars=
, a dethroned monopoly, and complex supply chains.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">How did this Mexican shrub become America=E2=
=80=99s best-selling holiday plant?</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">To find out, <em>The Hustle</em> talked to po=
insettia growers, breeders, salespeople, and historians.</p></div></div></t=
d></tr></tbody></table>
