<h2 style=3D"margin:0; line-height:125%; font-size:18px"><strong>Deep roots=
</strong></h2>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Indigenous to Southern Mexico, the poinsettia=
 (or <em>cuetlaxochitl</em>) was <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/C=
tc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VXdJJl2rPQ6rW7JK80z6p4Z2sVmLt1V5HkyHtN5wYXRF2-ZW0W7lCdLW=
