<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">For the next few centuries, the plant was cul=
tivated and celebrated in Mexico =E2=80=94 yet it remained obscure to the r=
est of the world.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Then, along came <strong>Joel Poinsett</stron=
g>.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Poinsett, a wealthy Southern Unionist and sla=
ve owner, was appointed as the first <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e=
3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VXdJJl2rPQ6rW7JK80z6p4Z2sVmLt1V5HkyHtN5wYXR22-ZW0W69=
sMD-6lZ3k-N7J1xZgZ24L3W2L95Cw6wR_DKW53X-PM784jxPN5NvRFBHh2MtW8TTJhP7dstqqW8=
ZYD_c1hr7DDW1VzkrV6lKcx8W3kM-gv8TZ8KbW2jf7Qp1FwyvCW47JnTx3NCTwzW79RG1M5Jkz1=
YW356MQF4GGzxtW6C5JFp4pnD2XN19csBfWpTlxN3GNrBTStk3fW74LyXw311J-lW1vnm3f61xr=
lZW4QygVG51f73FW6x3NxX2kWPQjW1L05M76S-KDkf4Pt3hY04" target=3D"_blank" rel=
=3D"noopener noreferrer" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data=
-hs-link-id-v2=3D"komPam0q">US minister to Mexico</a>.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">While there, he failed in an attempt to purch=
ase Texas and <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/=
VXdJJl2rPQ6rW7JK80z6p4Z2sVmLt1V5HkyHtN5wYXR22-ZW0W69sMD-6lZ3k-N8y9Y867yKnFV=
HZtD89l6DkGVYBn2w3WPx6GW1lvh3Z3QQJhhW3VM-rT6cfs-bW8mTQjG5xCmpLW4dM6H17_11Py=
N6JHQGWSXrMCW1js0kl2lGwCJW1qHMMh4mXhmgW1PstpC365tGLW4sth7C8lTDgjVq8q5q2MkGj=
YW86slQL2QXN1sW2l9SNZ15kqDQW79kfjZ8gvQCWW3JZ46s8LNyMYW1GBycH6H2Q3dW35vhTq2B=
Cl3HW4BYZGF5kpDvWf7nhmbW04" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" s=
tyle=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"U4KRkjBw=
">became</a> a persona non grata for meddling in the country=E2=80=99s inte=
rnal affairs.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">But on a trip to the Southern town of Taxco i=
n 1828, just before he was he recalled, he encountered the <em>flor de Noch=
ebuena</em> and was so struck by it that he shipped specimens back to the U=
S.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">The plant =E2=80=94 which eventually became k=
nown to Westerners as the =E2=80=9Cpoinsettia=E2=80=9D =E2=80=94 made its p=
ublic American debut at a flower show in Philadelphia and quickly became th=
e talk of the town.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">In news reports at the time, it was described=
 <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VXdJJl2rPQ6rW=
7JK80z6p4Z2sVmLt1V5HkyHtN5wYXRl2-ZW0W6N1vHY6lZ3nlW4ryrNQ5w-sB3W7fdR9N6p0M92=
W6mM_Gl5z9W0TW8tTB5x5Tr9_zVmZRFC63V6LxW14Wr265_5jzKW7CJX3G2TZ69LW4gYm0t1VvY=
ktVpVk7F2gdgMYW7zWm_J5vdZ80W83qmlD6dgXQXN4mDJd8rMhT4W8rGHFX2V_Fv1W4wbsvM2RG=
4_TVZHcb18G4Jw1W17d1wR24DTFbW8WCYrN31_bvbW5gfQn58k0M1dW15ZYn62z5SKlW7pZLpg5=
hS5ShW4-llr41k2j7-W24FCB791GRYWf41KS6804" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener=
 noreferrer" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-=
v2=3D"OBmuwlkY">as</a> =E2=80=9Cthe showiest flower to yet be seen=E2=80=9D=
 and praised for having =E2=80=9Cthe most brilliant scarlet [leaves] ]ever =
produced in the vegetable or mineral kingdom.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">By the end of the 19th century, nurserymen we=
re growing and distributing poinsettias for <strong>~$0.25</strong> ($8 tod=
ay) at local markets.</p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>
