;"><em><span style=3D"font-size: 12px;">Joel Roberts Poinsett (Library of C=
ongress, Charles Fenderich; photo illustration by The Hustle)</span></em></=
span></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">But several things worked against the poinset=
tia as a commercial entity.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">=E2=80=9CPerhaps no other plant or flower we =
