San Marcos archives)</span></em></span></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">The specifics of Ecke=E2=80=99s prized breedi=
ng technique =E2=80=94 which he acquired from an amateur German gardener =
=E2=80=94 were guarded with the intensity of the Coca-Cola recipe.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">=E2=80=9CNobody at the ranch knew the secret,=
=E2=80=9D his grandson, Paul Ecke III, later told the <em>Los Angeles Times=
</em>. =E2=80=9CMy grandfather, my dad, and their breeder knew, and it was =
done at the breeder=E2=80=99s home so nobody could see.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">The result was a fuller, hardier plant with m=
ore branches =E2=80=94 a product equipped to endure the tribulations of con=
sumerism.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">At the same time, under the leadership of Eck=
e=E2=80=99s son, Paul Jr., the company marketed the plant as the premier Ch=
ristmas decoration, sending free samples to women=E2=80=99s magazines and m=
aking the rounds on prime-time TV programs like =E2=80=9CThe Tonight Show.=
=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">By the 1990s, the family was selling<strong> =
500k+</strong> potted plants, and more than <strong>25m</strong> cuttings =
=E2=80=94 baby sections used to produce new plants =E2=80=94 to other growe=
rs on a royalty basis.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">At its peak, the company had a virtual monopo=
ly on the US poinsettia market, maintaining a <strong>90% market share</str=
ong> and 150+ <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/=
VXdJJl2rPQ6rW7JK80z6p4Z2sVmLt1V5HkyHtN5wYXR22-ZW0W69sMD-6lZ3n1W97s7jV45zfms=
W1pHyDH5lxgpLVLGzRC87ChRmW9b2bpx1mq_06W3mKl6r5Cy6g6N8GnNKyq9g8dVBdP0n1ndd_P=
W3LgS5r5vZQPhW1VkV1K46R8_bN8xT8lJY8hkHW6F6wQ04CRsZsW2pC02755NCPVW27Qv5n4FpB=
CxV7cyzZ44CNg7DP_VgNVxvTW3dVDrc5jf_ZmW6gvL2h6vbjb9W51XR-t2Nz_l0W55djhY5dbSz=
lW4MCjlZ1CwQdRf7Rm-jM04" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" styl=
e=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"bJfFvhIl">p=
atents</a>.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">=E2=80=9CThe Eckes of Southern California are=
 to poinsettias what De Beers of South Africa is to diamonds,=E2=80=9D one =
reporter later proclaimed.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">While competitors popped up, none could chall=
enge the exposure, prominence, and rich IP of Ecke Ranch.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">That is, until the worst possible scenario ca=
me to fruition.</p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>
