<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">In 1992, a graduate student named <strong>Joh=
n Dole</strong> got his hands on an Ecke cutting and managed to reverse-eng=
ineer the company=E2=80=99s top-secret process =E2=80=94 a method that invo=
lved grafting together 2 poinsettia plants.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">His <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/=
Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VXdJJl2rPQ6rW7JK80z6p4Z2sVmLt1V5HkyHtN5wYXRl2-ZW0W6N1vH=
Y6lZ3lXW6ytJhW4NY5gYW1yKrXF3bmTnCN721znFbBqf9W2tVFHR711t6jN8GnL--QdNsYW5nNn=
L55ST14_W7msCdr3QR_zZW7yHDd_5qLW8LW5ZT9Cr3q1BHMW8pg8bZ436Y56W9kSsm34jWkYJN8=
Fr0x4fY62dW4wG6-P4HM_P1N3yf-ckYrmQQW27ZW7r7wB0cZW17l4BT6lYK6PW4d6vYR6rmt73N=
3H1ksH_lWsRW6H1Gxq94pH6XW1C-mts3_XnmgW1DfPRM56yDgHN14JcvCw9QPyf772d0j04" ta=
rget=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs=
-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"559cmCEK">published findings</a> compl=
etely upended the poinsettia industry.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">=E2=80=9CYou don=E2=80=99t often see a situat=
ion in science where one paper makes a serious impact on the market,=E2=80=
=9D Dole, now an associate dean at North Carolina State University, told <e=
m>The Hustle</em>. =E2=80=9CBut in this case, it really did.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Competition flooded in, sparking a =E2=80=9Cg=
olden age=E2=80=9D for poinsettias:</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">The industry=E2=80=99s main focus shifted fro=
m cultivation to breeding, and dozens of <strong>new color variations</stro=
ng> popped up =E2=80=94 hues of white, yellow, neon green, and pink =E2=80=
=94 with names like =E2=80=9CPremium Picasso=E2=80=9D and =E2=80=9CMonet Tw=
ilight.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%"><strong>Big-box retailers</strong> also began=
 to change the dynamic of the market.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">=E2=80=9CIn the earlier years, poinsettias we=
re mostly sold at independent garden centers and were thought of as an upsc=
ale plant,=E2=80=9D says Dole. =E2=80=9CBut when the mass marketers started=
 selling them, that perception changed.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Home Depot, Lowes, and Walmart began purchasi=
ng vast quantities of poinsettias and selling them as <strong>loss leaders<=
/strong> for as little as <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+1=
13/d2q-Vf04/VXdJJl2rPQ6rW7JK80z6p4Z2sVmLt1V5HkyHtN5wYXRl2-ZW0W6N1vHY6lZ3nBW=
2pM08j3n52FjW64d_Hq90BrVhW1mqSp17FQFr6W6DsFtd8jy6M8W2Fh1C-4FYQ23W1Qzdbl3ZrG=
k5W1sxBCz8bF61hW1zJQy82Z5yq3N19NzF3LS7_9W7M-cg54t82D0W76KMk_1XRMZ5W8bpKJ56W=
WM1ZN7T-pZ-6t7ynVnNqz_5Q5x2PW66Dk9M54J7_SW2P_V9r5k9RPLN7RrcflkYwj-W8P5yhW45=
GCfJVz2tbN4HSvDtW7jKm7J1kSclLW1PJDZ87FbSC0W1W19cn585KDZf1cc5C-04" target=3D=
"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-i=
d=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"t2N/BvjR">$0.99</a> each.</p></div></div></td=
></tr></tbody></table>
