<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">These changes pressured growers to ruthlessly=
 cut overhead expenses to compete, eventually ushering in an era of consoli=
dation. Giant agriculture firms snatched up smaller outfits and <strong>shi=
fted production overseas</strong>.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">After slowly watching its monopoly decline, E=
cke =E2=80=94 the one-time king of poinsettias =E2=80=94 <a href=3D"https:/=
/media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VXdJJl2rPQ6rW7JK80z6p4Z2sVmLt1V5=
HkyHtN5wYXRl4ZwpbW6N1X8z6lZ3lzW1R1-bf8zKGMXW14V_sz45tTX2W1LryDs4VtBq7W8zwFV=
