 go wrong along the way.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">=E2=80=9CThere are always a few unexpected th=
ings that come up in agriculture,=E2=80=9D he says. =E2=80=9COne pest infes=
tation might set you back $60k and wipe out most of your margins.=E2=80=9D<=
/p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">COVID and ongoing supply chain issues have al=
so put a dent in Koeppler=E2=80=99s usual process.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">For instance, he used to import coconut coir =
=E2=80=94 the fibrous coconut husks inside shells =E2=80=94 from Indonesia =
to mix into his soil. But in recent years, he=E2=80=99s had to ditch it bec=
ause shipping costs have ballooned from $2.1k to $21k per container.</p></d=
iv></div></td></tr></tbody></table>
